#!args --verify-dirty
# ui.action_card (lib/ui/action_card.rs): a click and Enter and Space choose a card, a disabled one
# takes nothing and no Tab stop, Tab walks the cards in their order, the records are buttons by their
# names, a selected card says so, the texts are records of their own; shots light, dark and at 150 %.
# Ids: 100 .. 103 the cards, 104 the disabled one, 110 and 111 the rows.
size 760 620
theme light
expect button:"Karte mit Bild" exists
expect button:"Karte mit Symbol" exists
expect button:"Karte mit Plakette" exists
expect button:"kurz.txt" exists
expect text:"Die Zeichnung der App steht in der Fläche über den Texten." exists
expect text:"Heute 14:05" exists
expect text:"Gewählt: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]" exists
expect button:"Gewählte Karte" checked
expect button:"Karte mit Bild" unchecked
expect button:"Abgeschaltete Karte" disabled
# the pointer
click button:"Karte mit Bild"
expect text:"Gewählt: [1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]" exists
expect #100 focused
click button:"Karte mit Symbol"
expect text:"Gewählt: [1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]" exists
click button:"lang.txt"
expect text:"Gewählt: [1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]" exists
# a disabled card takes nothing
click button:"Abgeschaltete Karte"
expect text:"Gewählt: [1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]" exists
# the keyboard: Tab in their order past the disabled one, Enter and Space
focus #100
key enter
expect text:"Gewählt: [2, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]" exists
key tab
expect #101 focused
key space
expect text:"Gewählt: [2, 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1]" exists
key tab
expect #102 focused
key tab
expect #103 focused
key enter
expect text:"Gewählt: [2, 2, 0, 1, 0, 0, 1]" exists
key tab
expect #110 focused
key enter
expect text:"Gewählt: [2, 2, 0, 1, 0, 1, 1]" exists
key shift+tab
expect #103 focused
key tab
shot build/cardtest_light.png
theme dark
move 300,100
wait 50
shot build/cardtest_dark.png
scale 150
shot build/cardtest_dark_150.png
scale 100
theme light
size 420 620
shot build/cardtest_narrow.png
expect_nowarn
